	(text_box "DESIGN NOTE:\nCALC - SPLIT TERMINATION \nDifferential: R45 + R46 = 120.8 R (spec 120 R +/-10%) \nCommon-mode:  fc = 1/(2*pi*(R45||R46)*C68)\n                 = 1/(2*pi*30.2*47n) = 112 kHz\nCommon-mode choke deliberately omitted - no certification\nrequirement, sub-metre harness. Footprints not retained.\n\nCircuit is shown on the Interface - Interconnects sheet"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 185.42 107.9501 0)
		(size 60.96 24.1299)
